<h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; color: #000000;">Reset your password</h1>

<p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p style="margin-bottom: 32px; color: #4B5563;">
    We received a request to reset your password for your ProxySock account. 
    Click the button below to set a new password. This link will expire in 2 hours.
</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
    <a href="<%= @reset_url %>" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6B7280; margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-top: 24px;">
    If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.
</p>
